<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps reaffirms Carnival rating.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps reaffirms Carnival rating.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Thursday it reaffirmed its Single-A rating on Carnival Corp's senior unsecured debt and its D-One commercial paper rating.</p>
<p>About $680 million of Carnival's outstanding debt securities are affected.</p>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps said it also removed Carnival from Rating Watch-Down, after the company said it will no longer seek to acquire Celebrity Cruise Lines. Celebrity and Royal Caribbean Internation agreed to a $1.3 billion merger.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
